</style><p class="MsoNormal"><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif">Our records indicate that you are 60 days or more past due
on your Housing rental payments.<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">&nbsp; </span>Failure
to remain current on amounts owed is a direct violation of your license
agreement.<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">&nbsp; </span>Your account must be made
current by <span style="background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">1 week after
date of letter</span>; failure to bring your account current will result in
immediate termination of your license agreement.<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">&nbsp; </span><u><br></u></font></p><p class="MsoNormal"><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif"><u><br></u></font></p><p class="MsoNormal"><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif"><u>In order to remain in University Housing,
you need to pay <span style="background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">$X,XXX.XX</span>
by <span style="background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">1 week after date of
letter</span>.</u> <span style="mso-spacerun:yes">&nbsp;</span><br></font></p><p class="MsoNormal"><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif"><br></font></p><p class="MsoNormal"><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif">You may submit
payment via mail by check payable to ASU University Housing, Attn:<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif">Lorrie Woesner, PO Box 870212, Tempe, AZ
85287-0212 or in person at the Polytechnic Cashiering Services located in Quad
2, where acceptable forms of payment include cash or checks only.<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">&nbsp; </span>You may also pay online through your ASU
student account using MasterCard, Discover or American Express.<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">&nbsp; </span></font></p><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif">

</font><p class="MsoNormal"><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif"><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal">&nbsp;</b></font></p><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif">

</font><p class="MsoNormal"><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif">If payment is not received by <span style="background:yellow;
mso-highlight:yellow">1 week after date of letter</span>, your license
agreement will be terminated and your expected move out date will be <span style="background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">2 weeks after date of letter</span>.<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">&nbsp; </span>Please note that you can stop the termination
of your license agreement by paying your balance in full.<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">&nbsp; </span>You may also contact </font><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif">Lorrie Woesner
 (<a href="mailto:Lorrie.Woesner@asu.edu">lorrie.woesner@asu.edu</a> or
480-727-8273), Scott Patton (<a href="mailto:scott.patton@asu.edu">scott.patton@asu.edu</a><span class="MsoHyperlink"> </span>or 480-965-5702) or Jim Beadle (<a href="mailto:james.beadle@asu.edu">james.beadle@asu.edu</a> or 480-965-6658) to
discuss your account. </font></p><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif">

</font><p class="MsoNormal"><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif">&nbsp;</font></p><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif">

</font><p class="MsoNormal"><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif">If you feel this has reached you in error, or would like to
schedule an appointment to speak with someone, please send an e-mail addressing
your concerns no later than <span style="background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">1
week after date of letter</span> to <span class="MsoHyperlink"></span></font><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif"><a href="mailto:Lorrie.Woesner@asu.edu "><span class="MsoHyperlink"><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif">Lorrie.Woesner@asu.edu </font></span></a>or call 480-727-8273.<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">&nbsp; </span>Your e-mail
should include the name of the primary license holder, their affiliate ID,
campus address and specific information regarding your concerns.</font></p><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif">

</font><p class="MsoNormal"><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif">&nbsp;</font></p><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif">

</font><p class="MsoNormal"><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif">Again, it is very important that you bring your account
current.<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">&nbsp; </span>Failure to do so will result in
termination of your license agreement with an expected move out date of <span style="background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">2 weeks after date of letter</span>.</font></p><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif">

</font><p class="MsoNormal"><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif">&nbsp;</font></p><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif">

</font><p class="MsoNormal"><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif">Sincerely,</font></p><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif">

</font><p class="MsoNormal"><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif"><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">&nbsp;</span></font></p><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif">

